## Verification Commands

- `rtk env CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-verify-phase08-fetch-current cargo test -p jansu-storage --test fetch --no-default-features --features dynostore -- --nocapture`
- `rtk env CARGO_TARGET_DIR=/tmp/jansu-verify-phase08-fetch-broker-current cargo test -p jansu-broker --test fetch --no-default-features --features libsql,dynostore,slatedb -- --nocapture`
